Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passengerName": "testuser",
  "busId": "1636fc26-bb71-484f-87ac-06a82f043c79",
  "seatNumber": "A2"
}

### Test 2: Get bookings without JWT
GET {{host}}/api/booking

### Test 3: Get my bookings with JWT
GET {{host}}/api/booking
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

